  "title": "The binding problem",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "bee3be8a-0419-4477-a1f9-14f808be6a38",
      "text": "The binding problem is how information processed in distinct, spatially separated regions of the brain is brought together into one unified conscious percept. It is a general feature of consciousness in all its modes, not only of vision.",
